/h2>\n            <table class=\"comparison-table\">\n                <thead>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th>套餐</th>\n                        <th>月付</th>\n                        <th>年付</th>\n                        <th>流量</th>\n                        <th>设备支持</th>\n                        <th>核心权益</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td class=\"plan-name\">基础版</td>\n                        <td class=\"price\">¥15/月</td>\n                        <td class=\"annual\">按年付仅需 ¥150/年</td>\n                        <td>每月 100GB 极速流量</td>\n                        <td>支持 3 台设备同时在线</td>\n                        <td>解锁基础流媒体，普通线路节点池</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr class=\"featured\">\n                        <td class=\"plan-name\">旗舰版</td>\n                        <td class=\"price\">¥35/月</td>\n                        <td class=\"annual\">按年付仅需 ¥350/年</td>\n                        <td>每月 300GB 极速流量</td>\n                        <td>支持 5 台设备同时在线</td>\n                        <td>全节点原生流媒体解锁，IPLC 专线游戏加速优化，7x24 优先工单支持</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td class=\"plan-name\">团队版</td>\n                        <td class=\"price\">¥85/月</td>\n                        <td class=\"annual\">按年付仅需 ¥850/年</td>\n                        <td>每月 1000GB 极速流量</td>\n                        <td>支持 20 台设备同时在线</td>\n                        <td>VIP 专属高带宽节点，支持企业定制路由，专属客户经理服务</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"cards-grid\">\n            <div class=\"benefit-card\">\n                <div class=\"left-bar\"></div>\n                <div class=\"card-content\">\n                    <h3>流量无忧</h3>\n                    <p>无论基础版还是旗舰版，每月都有稳定的高速流量保障，让您在任何场景下都能保持高效连接。</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"benefit-card\">\n                <div class=\"left-bar\"></div>\n                <div class=\"card-content\">\n                    <h3>设备多联</h3>\n                    <p>从个人使用到家庭共享，多种套餐支持多台设备同时在线，满足您的全家需求。</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"benefit-card\">\n                <div class=\"left-bar\"></div>\n                <div class=\"card-content\">\n                    <h3>定制服务</h3>\n                    <p>团队版专属客户经理和企业定制路由，为企业用户提供专属支持。</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"faq\" class=\"faq-section\">\n            <h2 class=\"section-title\">常见问题</h2>\n            <div class=\"faq-grid\">\n                <div>\n                    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                        <div class=\"faq-question\">浪浪山(CrossWall) 是什么？</div>\n                        <div class=\"faq-answer\">浪浪山(CrossWall) 是一个提供安全网络连接服务的品牌，旨在帮助用户突破地域限制并保持在线隐私。</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                        <div class=\"faq-question\">如何选择适合我的套餐？</div>\n                        <div class=\"faq-answer\">基础版适合个人轻度使用，旗舰版适合重度流媒体爱好者，团队版适合大型团队或企业用户。</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                        <div class=\"faq-question\">支持哪些设备吗？</div>\n                        <div class=\"faq-answer\">是的，所有套餐都支持多台设备同时在线，具体配置请查看套餐详情。</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                        <div class=\"faq-question\">年付模式有什么优势？</div>\n                        <div class=\"faq-answer\">年付模式可节省约20%的费用，让长期使用更具性价比。</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                        <div class=\"faq-question\">如何获取更多流量？</div>\n                        <div class=\"faq-answer\">通过选择更高阶的套餐或关注我们的升级计划，您可以获得更多高速流量。</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                        <div class=\"faq-question\">客服支持如何？</div>\n                        <div class=\"faq-answer\">旗舰版和团队版均提供7x24 优先工单支持，响应更快。</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <footer>\n        <div class=\"bottom-nav\">\n            <a href=\"#\">\n                <span class=\"icon\">🏠</span>\n                首页\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"#plans\">\n                <span class=\"icon\">📦</span>\n                套餐\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"#faq\">\n                <span class=\"icon\">❓</span>\n                FAQ\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"#\">\n                <span class=\"icon\">👤</span>\n                关于\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </footer>",
